@startuml Sequence_AI_Review
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title Sequence Diagram: AI Code Review (BKDNOJ moi)

actor "Browser" as B
participant "Django Site" as Site
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "AI Provider\n(OpenAI/Gemini/\nClaude/DeepSeek)" as AI

== 1. User xem source code ==
B -> Site : GET /src/<submission_id>/
Site -> DB : SELECT Submission,\nSubmissionSource
Site --> B : Trang source code\n(co nut "Review with AI")

== 2. User yeu cau AI Review ==
B -> Site : POST /src/<id>/ai-review/\n{provider, model, output_language}

== 3. Kiem tra quyen ==
Site -> DB : SELECT Submission\nWHERE id=<id>
Site -> Site : Kiem tra user so huu\nsubmission nay

alt Da co review (cached)
  Site -> DB : SELECT AICodeReview\nWHERE submission=id, user=user
  DB --> Site : review record
  Site --> B : JSON {review_text}\n(cached, khong goi AI)
else Chua co review
  == 4. Lay API key ==
  Site -> DB : SELECT AIAPIKey\nWHERE user=user,\nprovider=provider,\nstatus='verified'
  DB --> Site : key_ciphertext

  Site -> Site : Giai ma API key\nbang Fernet\n(SHA-256 tu SECRET_KEY)

  == 5. Build prompt ==
  Site -> DB : SELECT AIPromptTemplate\nWHERE key='ai_code_review'
  DB --> Site : prompt_text template

  Site -> Site : Format prompt:\n{problem_name}\n{language_name}\n{result}\n{points}/{total_points}\n{output_language}

  == 6. Goi AI API ==
  Site -> AI : HTTPS POST\n{system_prompt, user_message:\nsource_code}\ntimeout=120s

  AI -> AI : Phan tich:\n1. Thuat toan & CTDL\n2. Luong thuc thi\n3. Time Complexity\n4. Space Complexity\n5. Code Quality

  AI --> Site : Response\n{analysis_text}

  == 7. Luu va tra ket qua ==
  Site -> DB : INSERT AICodeReview\n{submission, user, provider,\nmodel, review_text, output_language}
  Site -> Site : Xoa plaintext API key\nkhoi memory
  Site --> B : JSON {review_text}
end

B -> B : Hien thi ket qua\ntrong modal

@enduml
